Package: reproimage
Title: Integrity, Provenance and Reproducibility Checks for Scientific Images
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Fingerprints scientific images (file and pixel SHA-256,
    difference and perceptual hashes in eight orientations) and lists pairs
    that are identical or visually similar, with an RO-Crate provenance
    record. Implements the same specified algorithms as the ReproImage Python
    tool and is tested against the same reference images. Results describe
    visual relations between images, not misconduct.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/reproimage
BugReports: https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/reproimage/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    digest,
    jpeg,
    jsonlite,
    png,
    tiff
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
